&lt;h2&gt;


  Key Schema Modeling
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cv: Modular professional record (personalInfo, summary, sections[], isPrimary, isTailored, ownerId).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;jobDescription: Structured job representation storing raw source text, requirement trees, nested alternative groupings, and pendingReplacement tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cvMatch: Deterministic match assessments holding verbatim quoted citations, gap counts, rubric scores, and distributed evaluation leases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;application: Recruitment lifecycle tracker connecting confirmed JDs to tailored CV variants, cover letters, and recruitment stages (draft, applied, interviewing, offered, rejected).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

